{"id":"533640adc79e621f","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-measurable-embedding.md","title":"Measurable Cardinal Embedding","display":"thm-measurable-embedding — Measurable Cardinal Embedding","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-measurable-embedding","aliases":["58-thm-measurable-embedding","Measurable Cardinals and Embeddings","Keisler-Ulam Theorem"],"display":"thm-measurable-embedding — Measurable Cardinal Embedding","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-measurable-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-measurable-embedding</span><span>Measurable Cardinals and Embeddings</span><span>Keisler-Ulam Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-measurable-embedding — Measurable Cardinal Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md\">../batch10/58-df-measurable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\in V\\)</span> and class functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> are interpreted in the metatheory</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> 为元语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span> 为类量词记号，不是集合上的存在量词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> 表示总单值类函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>。公式、自由变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 与成员结构满意关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^r\">\\(V^r\\)</span> 仅表示长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的有限集合赋值类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V=V\">\\(\\mathbf V=V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> 在序数参数上表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land j:V\\to M\\land\\bigl[\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V^r\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_{L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to(\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]))\\bigr]\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land j:V\\to M\\land\\bigl[\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V^r\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_{L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to(\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]))\\bigr]\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The embedding is a proper-class function interpreted in the metatheory, not a set-sized map governed by the ordinary three-place structure-embedding predicate.</li>\n<li>The derived ultrafilter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:\\kappa\\in j(X)\\}\">\\(U=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:\\kappa\\in j(X)\\}\\)</span> is a normal measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Every measurable cardinal is in particular inaccessible and Mahlo.</li>\n<li>Kunen inconsistency rules out a nontrivial elementary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to V\">\\(j:V\\to V\\)</span> under the usual choice assumptions; here the target is an inner model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"reso